<title>USA: PHLX to list Advanced Logic, other options Feb 13.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Advanced Logic, other options Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Tuesday it would begin trading options on Advanced Logic Research Inc, Parexel International Corp, RAC Financial Group and SITEL Corp on February 13.</p>
<p>The following table lists the underlying stocks' ticker symbol, the options' strike prices, exercise months, position limits and specialist unit.</p>
<p>Strikes	  Exercises   Pos Lts  Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>7-1/2, 10,     Mar, Apr,   4,500    Paul Dry &amp; Co</p>
<p>12-1/2	   May, Aug</p>
<p>60, 65, 70     Mar, Apr,   4,500    Gateway Ptnrs</p>
<p>		   Jun, Sep</p>
<p>25, 30, 35     Mar, Apr,   10,500   Group One Ltd</p>
<p>		   Jul, Oct</p>
<p>17-1/2, 20,    Mar, Apr,   7,500    Group One Ltd</p>
<p>22-1/2	   Jul, Oct</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
